      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Material is journalistic material if it:  (a) has the character of news, current affairs or a documentary; or  (b) consists of commentary or opinion on, or analysis of, news, current affairs or a documentary; or  (c) consists of editorial content relating to news, current affairs or a documentary."
