        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the information was disclosed to the person by a credit provider under paragraph 21G(3)(c);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-22e-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) If: a person holds or held credit eligibility information about an individual; and the information was disclosed to the person by a credit provider under paragraph 21G(3)(c); the person must not use or disclose the information, or any personal information about the individual derived from that information.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on using or disclosing credit information.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) If: a person holds or held credit eligibility information about an individual; and the information was disclosed to the person by a credit provider under paragraph 21G(3)(c); the person must not use or disclose the information, or any personal information about the individual derived from that information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-22e-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(b) the information was disclosed to the person by a credit provider under paragraph 21G(3)(c);",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The credit provider has an obligation to ensure the information is not used or disclosed.",
