    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A CR code must set out how to apply Part IIIA provisions.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide a CR code that sets out how to apply Part IIIA provisions.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A CR code must:  (a) set out how one or more of the provisions of Part IIIA are to be applied or complied with;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A CR code must make provision for matters required or permitted by Part IIIA.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must make provision for matters required or permitted by Part IIIA.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A CR code must:  (b) make provision for, or in relation to, matters required or permitted by Part IIIA to be provided for by the registered CR code;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-2-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A CR code must bind all credit reporting bodies.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must bind all credit reporting bodies.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A CR code must:  (c) bind all credit reporting bodies;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A CR code must specify the credit providers that are bound by the code.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must specify the credit providers that are bound by the code.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A CR code must:  (d) specify the credit providers that are bound by the code, or a way of determining which credit providers are bound;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26n-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A CR code must specify any other entities subject to Part IIIA that are bound by the code.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must specify any other entities subject to Part IIIA that are bound by the code.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) A CR code must:  (e) specify any other entities subject to Part IIIA that are bound by the code, or a way of determining which of those entities are bound."
    },
