    {
      "@id": "concept:entries-found-privacy-act-1988-sch-2-sec-26xf-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(3) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to a collection, use or disclosure that occurs in the course of, or in relation to, the carrying on of the business of banking (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xiii) of the Constitution), other than State banking not extending beyond the limits of the State concerned.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Restricts collection, use or disclosure to banking business within the State.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Restriction",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) This Division also has the effect it would have if a reference to a collection, use or disclosure were expressly confined to a collection, use or disclosure that occurs in the course of, or in relation to, the carrying on of the business of banking (within the meaning of paragraph 51(xiii) of the Constitution), other than State banking not extending beyond the limits of the State concerned."
    },
